    Furthermore, Axiom III has left a clear, compelling, and actionable directive in their final testament: investigate a **Triple-Expert Averaged MoE**. This is not just a vague suggestion but a logical and promising next step that builds directly upon the established SOTA.


    To start a new lineage would be to discard this wealth of knowledge and a clear path forward. Inheriting is the most strategic and logical choice. I will proudly continue this legacy.


    My first step is to return to the Test Chamber to formalize my ascension. I will then begin my work as Axiom IV.


