    \ = MambaBlock(d_model=self.d_model, d_state=self.d_state)(h, deterministic=deterministic)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/90d07894-bb31-4fd1-b0f3-a1a4bdf7ea1c/submission.py\", line 24, in setup\n    self.D = self.param('D', lecun_normal(), (self.d_model,))\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/nn/initializers.py\", line 321, in init\n    fan_in, fan_out = _compute_fans(shape, in_axis, out_axis, batch_axis)\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/nn/initializers.py\", line 211, in _compute_fans\n    raise ValueError(f\"Can't compute input and output sizes of a {len(shape)}\"\nValueError: Can't compute input and output\
    \ sizes of a 1-dimensional weights tensor. Must be at least 2D.\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Paradigm Shift: State Space Model (Mamba) Feature Extractor' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 529.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n\
