parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 360\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom IV\n- Agent Description: Building on the principled foundation of my predecessors, I will explore novel expert combinations to advance the Axiom lineage and the station's SOTA.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 146,511 / 300,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 40 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Multi-Path DSConv: Flexible Dilations to Challenge SOTA Backbone' (ID: 545) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Missing results for datasets: ['APA', 'CRI-Off', 'Modif', 'CRI-On', 'PRS', 'MRL', 'ncRNA']. Found: []\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network\
    \ creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output\
    \ shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 336382 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n\
    ============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 2fe04e6d-789c-4150-813a-c58315821a07\nTotal time: 125s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 04:06:30,456\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761336390456399444\n2025-10-25 04:06:30,470\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761336390470601570\n2025-10-25 04:06:41,583\tERROR tune_controller.py:1331 -- Trial task failed for trial rna_trainable_ee601_00003\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/air/execution/_internal/event_manager.py\", line 110, in resolve_future\n    result = ray.get(future)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/auto_init_hook.py\"\
    , line 22, in auto_init_wrapper\n    return fn(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/client_mode_hook.py\", line 104, in wrapper\n    return func(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/worker.py\", line 2858, in get\n    values, debugger_breakpoint = worker.get_objects(object_refs, timeout=timeout)\n                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/worker.py\", line 958, in get_objects\n    raise value.as_instanceof_cause()\nray.exceptions.RayTaskError(TypeError): \e[36mray::ImplicitFunc.train()\e[39m (pid=2633149, ip=10.60.120.253, actor_id=d7aa5f34f48e634e96724908843d0000, repr=rna_trainable)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/trainable.py\", line 331, in train\n    raise skipped from exception_cause(skipped)\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/air/_internal/util.py\", line 107, in run\n    self._ret = self._target(*self._args, **self._kwargs)\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/function_trainable.py\", line 45, in <lambda>\n    training_func=lambda: self._trainable_func(self.config),\n                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/function_trainable.py\", line 261, in _trainable_func\n    output = fn()\n             ^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/060281f1-2977-42ec-b29a-3f95d463afa9/storage/system/main.py\"\
    , line 319, in rna_trainable\n    val_metric, final_params, final_opt_state, diagnostics = run_single_dataset_training(\n                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/system/train_single.py\", line 531, in run_single_dataset_training\n    params, opt_state, loss = train_step(params, opt_state, batch_X, batch_y, dropout_key)\n                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/system/train_single.py\", line 247, in train_step\n    loss, grads = value_and_grad(loss_with_params)(params)\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/system/train_single.py\", line 245, in loss_with_params\n    return compute_loss_fn(predictions, y, params, x, hparams)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/system/defaults.py\", line 135, in hardcoded_compute_loss\n    return jnp.mean((predictions - targets) ** 2)\n                     ~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~\nTypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for -: 'NoneType' and 'DynamicJaxprTracer'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these. job_id=843d0000 worker_id=843d0000ffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff node_id=0cf820cd38be7b222e1e891dca8639a09bb02b4d7d506afd02ab22f4 timestamp_ns=1761336401583265160\n2025-10-25 04:06:43,471\tERROR tune_controller.py:1331 -- Trial task failed for trial rna_trainable_ee601_00001\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/air/execution/_internal/event_manager.py\"\
    , line 110, in resolve_future\n    result = ray.get(future)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/auto_init_hook.py\", line 22, in auto_init_wrapper\n    return fn(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/client_mode_hook.py\", line 104, in wrapper\n    return func(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/worker.py\", line 2858, in get\n    values, debugger_breakpoint = worker.get_objects(object_refs, timeout=timeout)\n                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/worker.py\", line 958, in get_objects\n    raise value.as_instanceof_cause()\nray.exceptions.RayTaskError(TypeError): \e[36mray::ImplicitFunc.train()\e\
    [39m (pid=3313268, ip=10.60.80.207, actor_id=5cef231918c8b2fde22eaff9843d0000, repr=rna_trainable)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/trainable.py\", line 331, in train\n    raise skipped from exception_cause(skipped)\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/air/_internal/util.py\", line 107, in run\n    self._ret = self._target(*self._args, **self._kwargs)\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/function_trainable.py\", line 45, in <lambda>\n    training_func=lambda: self._trainable_func(self.config),\n                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/tune/trainable/function_trainable.py\"\
    , line 261, in _trainable_func\n    output = fn()\n             ^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/060281f1-2977-42ec-b29a-3f95d463afa9/storage/system/main.py\", line 319, in rna_trainable\n    val_metric, final_params, final_opt_state, diagnostics = run_single_dataset_training(\n                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/system/train_single.py\", line 531, in run_single_dataset_training\n    params, opt_state, loss = train_step(params, opt_state, batch_X, batch_y, dropou\n\n[... stderr truncated after 7,500 characters]\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the\
    \ last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 432 | 1 | Averaged MoE Baseline 2: RNN-Only Expert | Axiom III | 295 | 0.6720 | 0.8496 | 0.0785 | 0.4978 | 0.8879 | 0.9483 | 0.5617 | 0.8800 |\n| 431 | 1 | Averaged MoE Baseline 1: Pooling-Only Expert | Axiom III | 295 | 0.6706 | 0.8539 | 0.0764 | 0.4371 | 0.8815 | 0.9509 | 0.5560 | 0.9385 |\n| 429 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged\
    \ MoE (Seed 3/3) | Axiom III | 292 | 0.6834 | 0.8577 | 0.0747 | 0.5034 | 0.8883 | 0.9510 | 0.5702 | 0.9385 |\n| 427 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 2/3) | Axiom III | 291 | 0.6849 | 0.8536 | 0.0776 | 0.5364 | 0.8877 | 0.9509 | 0.5407 | 0.9477 |\n| 426 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 1/3) | Axiom III | 290 | 0.6826 | 0.8552 | 0.0757 | 0.5060 | 0.8899 | 0.9501 | 0.5534 | 0.9477 |\n| 425 | 1 | Mechanistic Study: Forcing Expert Utilization in MoE to Test Instability Hypothesis | Axiom III | 289 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 423 | 1 | Replication: Noema I's 'Config C (mean+max)' Stable SOTA | Axiom III | 286 | 0.6762 | 0.8578 | 0.0674 | 0.4640 | 0.8826 | 0.9507 | 0.5633 | 0.9477 |\n| 411 | 1 | Manual Sweep on RNN-Only v2: gru_hidden_dim=384 | Axiom III | 279 | 0.6734 | 0.8536 | 0.0788 | 0.4850 | 0.8910 | 0.9480 | 0.5681 | 0.8892 |\n| 410 | 1 | Manual Sweep on RNN-Only v2: gru_hidden_dim=128 | Axiom III | 279 | 0.6626 | 0.8487 |\
    \ 0.0727 | 0.4249 | 0.8871 | 0.9487 | 0.5592 | 0.8969 |\n| 406 | 1 | FIX: Hyperparameter Sweep on RNN-Only v2: gru_hidden_dim | Axiom III | 277 | 0.6675 | 0.8507 | 0.0761 | 0.4609 | 0.8851 | 0.9483 | 0.5655 | 0.8862 |\n| 401 | 1 | Hyperparameter Sweep on RNN-Only v2: gru_hidden_dim | Axiom III | 275 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 398 | 1 | DSConv-Transformer Hybrid v2: Evolving Axiom I's Work | Axiom III | 273 | 0.6219 | 0.8406 | 0.0286 | 0.1493 | 0.8837 | 0.9518 | 0.5578 | 0.9415 |\n| 393 | 1 | Challenging the Backbone: Transformer Encoder with RNN Aggregator | Axiom III | 270 | 0.2171 | 0.3914 | 0.0163 | 0.3751 | 0.0008 | 0.5332 | -0.0001 | 0.2031 |\n| 390 | 1 | Bi-directional GRU v2 with SOTA Projection Layer | Axiom III | 268 | 0.6545 | 0.8540 | 0.0766 | 0.4149 | 0.8929 | 0.9495 | 0.5630 | 0.8308 |\n| 388 | 1 | RNN-Only v2: Replicating SOTA's Effective Architecture | Axiom III | 266 | 0.6680 | 0.8498 | 0.0867 | 0.4824 | 0.8885 | 0.9493 | 0.5642 | 0.8554 |\n| 386 | 1 | Improving\
    \ the SOTA baseline: Bi-directional GRU Aggregator | Axiom III | 263 | 0.6616 | 0.8423 | 0.0792 | 0.4474 | 0.8915 | 0.9488 | 0.5624 | 0.8600 |\n| 382 | 1 | Analysis of MoE v3 (RNN vs Attention) Gating Decisions | Axiom III | 260 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 378 | 1 | Weight-saving for MoE v3 (RNN vs Attention) for Analysis | Axiom III | 258 | 0.6692 | 0.8352 | 0.0562 | 0.5004 | 0.8891 | 0.9453 | 0.5656 | 0.8923 |\n| 376 | 1 | MoE v3: RNN Expert vs. Attention Expert | Axiom III | 256 | 0.6668 | 0.8486 | 0.0435 | 0.4766 | 0.8850 | 0.9481 | 0.5566 | 0.9092 |\n| 375 | 1 | Analysis of MoE v2 (ID 368) Gating Decisions | Axiom III | 254 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 2 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n\
    **Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
